        <type>void</type>
        <definition>void Input::Update</definition>
        <argsstring>()</argsstring>
        <name>Update</name>
        <qualifiedname>Input::Update</qualifiedname>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Updates the input state (should be called once per frame). </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Updates input state for the current frame.</para>
<para>Saves the previous state of keys and mouse buttons, then fetches the current keyboard state. Resets mouse delta and scroll delta.</para>
<para>This method should be called once per frame, after processing events. It saves the previous state of keys and mouse buttons for transition detection, fetches the current keyboard state, and resets all delta values. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
        <inbodydescription>
        </inbodydescription>
